FSPEED-REFUSED lane=gbdt-depthwise arm=catboost-cpu reason=GPU-PATH-ONLY: catboost-cpu is a CPU arm and this box has an accelerator. On NVIDIA and AMD we compare against the vendor's GPU path only; their CPU path is the MacBook's.
FSPEED-REFUSED lane=gbdt-depthwise arm=catboost-gpu-deterministic reason=NOT-OFFERED: CatBoost documents no deterministic GPU configuration; official doc (features/training-on-gpu): "Training on GPU is non-deterministic, because the order of floating point summations is non-deterministic in this implementation."
FSPEED-REFUSED lane=gbdt-depthwise arm=xgboost-cpu reason=GPU-PATH-ONLY: xgboost-cpu is a CPU arm and this box has an accelerator. On NVIDIA and AMD we compare against the vendor's GPU path only; their CPU path is the MacBook's.
FSPEED-REFUSED lane=gbdt-depthwise arm=xgboost-gpu-deterministic reason=NOT-OFFERED: no documented deterministic parameter for tree_method='hist' on device='cuda' (no deterministic_histogram in the current Parameters page); the fast arm's per-round hash column records whether it repeats.
FSPEED-NOTE lane=gbdt-depthwise arm=catboost-gpu-diag-newton1 DIAG: catboost-gpu with leaf_estimation_iterations=1 -- ONE Newton step per leaf instead of CatBoost's ten with backtracking, which is XGBoost's leaf estimator; NOT an incumbent row (DEVIATION 2283)
FSPEED-NOTE lane=gbdt-depthwise arm=catboost-gpu-diag-l2newton1 DIAG: catboost-gpu with leaf_estimation_iterations=1, score_function='L2' -- L2 split gain (XGBoost's) instead of Cosine, plus one Newton step: CatBoost walked all the way to XGBoost's estimation arm; NOT an incumbent row (DEVIATION 2283)
FSPEED-NOTE lane=gbdt-depthwise arm=catboost-gpu-diag-rs0 DIAG: catboost-gpu with random_strength=0 -- no random split-score noise (CatBoost's default random_strength is 1; XGBoost and ours add none); NOT an incumbent row (DEVIATION 2283)
FSPEED-NOTE lane=gbdt-depthwise arm=xgboost-gpu-diag-maxbin1024 DIAG: xgboost-gpu with max_bin=1024 -- a finer quantization grid than the lane's 255 bins; does XGBoost's GPU learner leave accuracy on the grid; NOT an incumbent row (DEVIATION 2283)
FSPEED-NOTE lane=gbdt-depthwise arm=xgboost-gpu-diag-mcw0 DIAG: xgboost-gpu with min_child_weight=0 -- no hessian floor on a child (XGBoost's default is 1.0; CatBoost and ours have no such floor); NOT an incumbent row (DEVIATION 2283)
FSPEED-NOTE lane=gbdt-depthwise arm=xgboost-gpu-diag-lossguide64 DIAG: xgboost-gpu with grow_policy='lossguide', max_depth=0, max_leaves=64 -- leaf-wise growth, 64 leaves, depth unbounded, beside the level-wise depth-6 tree on the same data; NOT an incumbent row (DEVIATION 2283)
